<mxCell id="x14" value="Read each column from top to bottom, A to G: F and G share the last one. Diamonds are decisions, and every branch out of one is labelled; “given” means set in the project file. Dashed steps are planned, not scripted yet. One command runs every scripted step in order: &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:IBM Plex Mono,monospace;font-size:15.86px&quot;&gt;python3 dwf.py &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.dwf&lt;/span&gt;. Each phase writes summary.txt (for you to read) and results.json (for the later phases) in its own folder." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3A400%2C600%2C700;fontSize=16.87;fontColor=#55544f;" vertex="1" parent="page" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="39.24" y="88.33" width="3601.75" height="27.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
